{"unit_id": "ValenscoA__dsh-carbon#feature-1", "repo": "ValenscoA/dsh-carbon", "commit": "4df1ff26b7ca39cee3ca52da1a843431b1ee9790", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-carbon** 的功能「会话碳排估算」：按会话中各模型的输入、缓存和输出 token 用量，结合因子表计算 CO₂e，并给出低值、高值和因子置信等级。CLI 与 Web 报告均可查看。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/core/carbon.mjs:51-75"]}
{"unit_id": "ValenscoA__dsh-carbon#feature-2", "repo": "ValenscoA/dsh-carbon", "commit": "4df1ff26b7ca39cee3ca52da1a843431b1ee9790", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-carbon** 的功能「历史会话汇总」：同步并保存每个会话的 token 记录，支持按日期范围汇总、查看模型及会话拆分；历史记录在原始会话日志不再存在时仍保留。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/core/history.mjs:110-180"]}
{"unit_id": "ValenscoA__dsh-carbon#feature-3", "repo": "ValenscoA/dsh-carbon", "commit": "4df1ff26b7ca39cee3ca52da1a843431b1ee9790", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-carbon** 的功能「Web 碳足迹面板」：在 DSH 侧栏提供 Carbon 页面，显示时间线、排放估算、会话与模型摘要及方法说明；可切换统计区间和基础设施情景。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/client/index.jsx:46-59"]}
